Org11
=====

Stage 11 of the organiser made in the book "Writing Desktop
Applications in JavaScript" (Manuals.JSApps), chapter 11.

This stage adds the Diary: the year,
a month, a week or a day (the toolbox's view buttons), moving about
with the arrow keys and Page Up and Page Down; Today (or Home) goes
to today.

The finished organiser is !Organiser.
